OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 79, charged over fatal crash
OL,4,Aoutside supermarket
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 79-year-old man has been arrested and
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with a fatal
OL,8,Fcrash in a supermarket car park in
OL,9,FEdinburgh.
OL,11,FBill Hepburn, 66, was struck by a car
OL,12,Foutside Tesco Extra on Meadow Place
OL,13,FRoad, Corstorphine, on 18 February. He
OL,14,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland said the man would be
OL,17,Freported to the procurator fiscal in
OL,18,Fdue course.
OL,20,FThere were no other reported injuries
OL,21,Fin the incident.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
